ily Sharing", "slug": "family-sharing", "language": "eng", "games_count": 30523, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/68b/68bcfe02c9b9b7123edab7ecce3f2660.jpg"}, {"id": 568, "name": "Time Management", "slug": "time-management", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2607, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/006/006aeb072314f08590e7ab6b38e7721b.jpg"}, {"id": 92228, "name": "Stereo Sound", "slug": "stereo-sound", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2157, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/50c/50ca35b80bd7a35a1a7d9fecdbcd6517_kJS1cIB.jpg"}, {"id": 92227, "name": "Custom Volume Controls", "slug": "custom-volume-controls", "language": "eng", "games_count": 3920, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/c14/c148c1e52dac195fd28158834360fb97.jpg"}, {"id": 666, "name": "cooking", "slug": "cooking", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2031, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/e16/e160657a46708e89a62a0b5040c47e95.jpg"}, {"id": 66655, "name": "Кулинария", "slug": "kulinariia", "language": "eng", "games_count": 904, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/957/9578b50f55c9c5336c45bbc318a1d47f.jpg"}, {"id": 92225, "name": "Playable without Timed Input", "slug": "playable-without-timed-input", "language": "eng", "games_count": 4012, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/ffc/ffc03c98caaff1651237ffdabe57ec37.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 42058, "name": "Strange Scaffold", "slug": "strange-scaffold", "games_count": 14, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/5ca/5cacba974a616a6e6112d3ae949b8e92.jpg"}, {"id": 61480, "name": "Frosty Pop", "slug": "frosty-pop", "games_count": 8, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/3f2/3f20b7425612de7e7ff555210157f056.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking is exactly what the name suggests. You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.In this absurdist online multiplayer horror game, 2-4 of your favorite people (or more, if you want to risk your computers/sanity) must use traps, proximity voice chat, and Gregorian chanting among other tools to feed giant monsters known as 'kaiju', gather treasure, and prevent the apocalypse.You have 10 minutes.Don't stay in the Larder.Don't get caught.FeaturesFlexible tag-based cooking system. Chop ingredients, salt them, burn them--and then fire them into a kaiju's jaws!A story about grappling with your faith as your leaders begin to die off, leaving you to carry the torch, told across 13 levels.The first-ever multiplayer project from the developers behind Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century."}